textfield.mcc/MUIA_TextField_DefaultWidth

    NAME: MUIA_TextField_DefaultWidth,     LONG

    SPECIAL INPUTS


    FUNCTION
        Set the width of the textwidth in number of characters.
        During during object creation, the visual width is set
        to this value. During a set, virtual width is set to this
        value. This is dependent upon the font width.


    EXAMPLE

